    <string name="how_title">How instant alerts work</string>
    <string name="how_text">Zero background drain: the app sleeps until your internet turns on — the system then wakes it for one quick fetch (that is how you get instant alerts), and a system-scheduled backup job runs only on unmetered networks. Offline = no battery use at all.</string>
